         scene linear lands AFTER the Rec.709 OETF (~41% coded signal),
         never at 18% screen level. 48dp touch target comes from the
         IconButton; Compose's Icon tints it via LocalContentColor.
         Vendored stroke path (material-icons-core has no such glyph). -->
